# Travel App — Module Federation context for Argent

This monorepo uses **Re.Pack (rspack)**, not Metro. Do **not** use `metro-mcp` or assume a single bundler.

## App identity

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Host app | `TravelHost` |
| Bundle ID (iOS) | `com.anonymous.travelhost` |
| Package (Android) | `com.anonymous.travelhost` |
| New Architecture | enabled (`newArchEnabled: true`) |

## Dev commands (run from repo root)

```bash
# Modo A — live federation (host + 4 remotes)
pnpm start

# Launch app (no bundler — uses running dev servers)
pnpm run:travel-host:ios
pnpm run:travel-host:android

# Modo B — prod-like CDN (pre-built bundles)
pnpm serve:remotes          # :4100
pnpm start:travel-host      # host only on :8081

# Android port forwarding (required before Android testing)
pnpm adbreverse
```

## Port map

| Service | Port |
|---------|------|
| TravelHost bundler | 8081 |
